@PocketWise.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5268

### Swagger UI
GET {{PocketWise.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger

###

### OpenAPI document
GET {{PocketWise.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Get current user settings
GET {{PocketWise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update current user settings
PUT {{PocketWise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "theme": "dark",
  "currencyCode": "THB",
  "locale": "th-TH",
  "emailBudgetAlertsEnabled": true
}

### Update current user profile
PUT {{PocketWise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "displayName": "PocketWise User",
  "phoneNumber": null,
  "birthDate": null
}

### Reset current user's financial data (irreversible)
POST {{PocketWise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/me/data-reset
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
